{"step_index":135,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T16:15:45Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Updated walkthrough explaining the fix for full 3x3 matrix height expansion (showing all 9 elements and full brackets) by setting dynamic Single Line Spacing.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Half-Yearly Examination 2026–27: Class XII Mathematics\n## Final Walkthrough & Updated Delivery\n\n### Summary of Completed Files\nAll Question Papers and Marking Schemes have been updated with:\n1. **Dynamic Line Height for Matrices & Determinants:**\n   - Paragraphs containing $3 \\times 3$ matrices, $2 \\times 2$ matrices, and $3 \\times 3$ determinants now explicitly use **Single Line Spacing (`line_spacing_rule = SINGLE`, `line_spacing = None`)**.\n   - This allows Microsoft Word to **dynamically expand the line height** to fit all 3 rows (all 9 elements) and brackets, resolving the vertical clipping issue where only 1 row (3 numbers) was visible.\n2. **Native MS Word OMML Equation Brackets:**\n   - **Square Brackets $[ \\dots ]$** for all $3 \\times 3$, $2 \\times 2$ matrices and column vectors ($X, B$).\n   - **Vertical Bar Brackets $| \\dots |$** for all $3 \\times 3$ determinants.\n3. **High-Contrast 300 DPI Embedded Diagrams:**\n   - Solid white backgrounds for Case Studies and Assertion–Reason questions without picture clipping.\n4. **100% NCERT Rationalized Syllabus Compliance:**\n   - Zero deleted syllabus topics (Tangents & Normals replaced with Rate of Change, Maxima/Minima, Revenue/Cost).\n\n---\n\n#### File Locations\nDirectory: `C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\math_exam_2026\\`\n\n1. **Set A Question Paper**\n   - Word Document: [Set_A_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_A_Question_Paper.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.txt)\n\n2. **Set A Marking Scheme & Step-by-Step Solutions**\n   - Word Document: [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.txt)\n\n3. **Set B Question Paper**\n   - Word Document: [Set_B_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_B_Question_Paper.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.txt)\n\n4. **Set B Marking Scheme & Step-by-Step Solutions**\n   - Word Document: [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx)\n   - Text Source: [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.txt)\n","Description":"Updated walkthrough explaining full matrix height expansion fix.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\b78a5d36-6586-4c94-a487-70da0c9f5362\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough artifact"}}]}
